{"seq":3,"slug":"ideological-lineage","title":"思想谱系与传承","stage":"DONE","category":"chinese-leadership-synthesis","categoryLabel":"中国领导集体与思想传承","chapterCount":3,"docCount":9,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/chinese-leadership-synthesis/ideological-lineage","rating":{"composite":3.5,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.67,"strategic":3.5},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.05,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/leaders/07_chinese-leadership-synthesis/3_ideological-lineage","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"思想谱系与传承-简介\">思想谱系与传承 简介</h1><p>本知识库以思想史的视角系统考察中国共产党历代领导人思想之间的传承关系、核心线索和内在张力，为理解中国政治思想的连续性与创新性提供贯通性的分析框架。思想谱系研究既关注代际之间的继承与发展，也重视每一阶段理论创新的独特贡献，是理解中国当代政治发展的重要学术路径。</p>\n<p>本知识库适合从事中国政治思想史研究、马克思主义中国化研究的学者和学生，以及希望从整体上把握中国领导人思想脉络的读者。建议阅读前对本系列前七个知识库的内容有基本了解。</p>\n<p>全书共分三章，按照传承链条、核心线索、比较反思的逻辑层次展开。</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>传承链条</strong>分别考察从毛泽东到邓小平的历史转型、从邓小平到江泽民的理论延续、从江泽民胡锦涛到新时代的发展脉络，勾勒出思想传承的完整链条。</p>\n<p>第二章<strong>核心线索</strong>从马克思主义中国化主线、现代化建设主线、人民立场主线三条贯穿性线索出发，揭示历代领导人思想中一以贯之的核心关切。</p>\n<p>第三章<strong>比较反思</strong>围绕统一性与多样性、创新与继承、理论与实践三组关系展开比较分析，在更高层次上总结中国政治思想演进的规律与启示。</p>\n<p>建议读者先通过传承链条建立代际关系的整体图景，再从核心线索中理解思想演进的深层逻辑，最后在比较反思中形成综合性的理论认识。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"inheritance-chain","title":"传承链条","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/chinese-leadership-synthesis/ideological-lineage/inheritance-chain","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"mao-to-deng-transition","title":"毛到邓转型","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/chinese-leadership-synthesis/ideological-lineage/inheritance-chain/mao-to-deng-transition"},{"seq":2,"slug":"deng-to-jiang-continuity","title":"邓到江延续","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/chinese-leadership-synthesis/ideological-lineage/inheritance-chain/deng-to-jiang-continuity"},{"seq":3,"slug":"jiang-hu-to-xi-development","title":"江胡到习发展","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/chinese-leadership-synthesis/ideological-lineage/inheritance-chain/jiang-hu-to-xi-development"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"core-threads","title":"核心线索","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/chinese-leadership-synthesis/ideological-lineage/core-threads","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sinicization-thread","title":"中国化线索","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/chinese-leadership-synthesis/ideological-lineage/core-threads/sinicization-thread"},{"seq":2,"slug":"modernization-thread","title":"现代化线索","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/chinese-leadership-synthesis/ideological-lineage/core-threads/modernization-thread"},{"seq":3,"slug":"peoples-thread","title":"人民性线索","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/chinese-leadership-synthesis/ideological-lineage/core-threads/peoples-thread"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"comparative-reflection","title":"比较反思","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/chinese-leadership-synthesis/ideological-lineage/comparative-reflection","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"unity-and-diversity","title":"统一与多样","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/chinese-leadership-synthesis/ideological-lineage/comparative-reflection/unity-and-diversity"},{"seq":2,"slug":"innovation-and-inheritance","title":"创新与继承","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/chinese-leadership-synthesis/ideological-lineage/comparative-reflection/innovation-and-inheritance"},{"seq":3,"slug":"theory-and-practice","title":"理论与实践","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/chinese-leadership-synthesis/ideological-lineage/comparative-reflection/theory-and-practice"}]}]}